re now partially filled. I see 3 hearts all outlined — maybe they're \"empty\" (background) meaning Link died. But game continues.\n\nWait, I bet what happened: Link took damage down to 0 and is in the death sequence, but the screenshot caught a frame where the death spin happened and screen area was drawn. Hmm.\n\nLet me just check by taking another screenshot after a second.\n\nActually let me read some memory: Link's health. I don't know the address yet.\n\nLet me take a screenshot now (game still running)."}
